PHP 8.2 Migration Summary

Here's a step-by-step summary of everything done to migrate from Homebrew PHP 8.5 to PHP 8.2 with Redis and Memcached extensions:

1. Remove Homebrew PHP 8.5

brew uninstall --ignore-dependencies --force php

2. Add shivammathur/php Tap

brew tap shivammathur/php

3. Install PHP 8.2 from shivammathur

brew install shivammathur/php/php@8.2

4. Link PHP 8.2 as Default

brew link --force --overwrite php@8.2

5. Verify PHP Installation

php --version
# Should show: PHP 8.2.30

php-config --extension-dir
# Should show: /opt/homebrew/Cellar/php@8.2/8.2.30/pecl/20220829

6. Install Redis Extension

pecl install redis

7. Install Memcached Extension

pecl install -D 'with-zlib-dir="/opt/homebrew/opt/zlib" enable-memcached-igbinary="no" enable-memcached-msgpack="no" enable-memcached-json="no" enable-memcached-protocol="no"' memcached

8. Clean Up Old PHP 8.1 Configuration

perl -i.bak -pe 's/^extension="(redis|memcached|opentelemetry)\.so"/;extension="$1.so" ; Disabled - using PHP 8.2/' /opt/homebrew/etc/php/8.1/php.ini

9. Verify Extensions Loaded

php -m | grep -E "(redis|memcached)"
# Should show:
# memcached
# redis

php -r "echo class_exists('RedisCluster') ? 'RedisCluster: OK' : 'RedisCluster: MISSING'; echo PHP_EOL;"
php -r "echo class_exists('Memcached') ? 'Memcached: OK' : 'Memcached: MISSING'; echo PHP_EOL;"
# Should show both as OK

10. Verify No Startup Errors

php -v 2>&1 | grep -i warning
# Should return nothing (no warnings)

